      "id": "example-negative-angle",
      "question": "Evaluate \\(\\cos(-60^\\circ)\\).",
      "solution": "Cosine is an even function, so \\(\\cos(-60^\\circ)=\\cos60^\\circ=\\frac{1}{2}\\)."
    },
